{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22003","headline":"秦中吟十首 歌舞 · 白居易","name":"秦中吟十首 歌舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦中岁云暮，大雪满皇州。\n雪中退朝者，朱紫尽公候。\n贵有风雪兴，富无饥寒忧。\n所营唯第宅，所务在追游。\n朱门车马客，红烛歌舞楼。\n欢酣促密坐，醉煖脱重裘。\n秋官爲主人，廷尉居上头。\n日中爲一乐，夜半不能休。\n岂知阌乡狱，中有冻死囚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}